        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Schlesinger, Waldo Salt, Jon Voight, Dustin Hoffman, Martin Sheen, Robert Loggia, Helen Shaver\n- Products: Midnight Cowboy, Darling, Sunday Bloody Sunday, The Believers\n- Roles: director, writer, actor\n- Topics: Academy Award for Best Director, film nominations\n\nFacts:\n- John Schlesinger was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director for Darling.\n- John Schlesinger won the Academy Award for Best Director for Midnight Cowboy.\n- Midnight Cowboy was written by Waldo Salt, directed by John Schlesinger, and starred Jon Voight alongside Dustin Hoffman.\n- John Schlesinger was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director for Sunday Bloody Sunday.\n- The Believers is a 1987 American neo-noir thriller film directed by John Schlesinger.\n- The Believers was released in 1987 and starred Martin Sheen, Robert Loggia, and Helen Shaver.",
